# Files the kit used to ship and no longer does, one path per line, such as ai/old-module.md.
# An update deletes a file from a repository only if this list names it, the repository's
# manifest listed it, and it is unchanged since it was installed. It keeps anything else under ai/
# that the kit doesn't ship, and ai/sync.sh --check names it. A kit change that removes a file from
# ai/ adds its path here in the same commit. Never take a path out of this list.
